Z||000000||Ken Wittlief||06-28-2001||10:28 AM||||Daughter takes the car last night, I had the sunroof out.<P>I hear her coming home around midnight, Im half asleep.<P>  Something didnt seem right, so I called out - "did you put the sunroof back in?"<P>"No its too dark - I cant see out there"<P>  so I get up and put the sunroof back in, AND close the windows - if I didnt ask her I wonder if she would have just gone to bed and left it that way?!<P>  makes me wonder how many people have left their roof out all night and went out the next day to a soppy car?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||06-28-2001||11:03 AM||||I have left it open, but not off all night.  And in a gentle rain, I hardly got any water in.  Leaving the side windows open was another story.||||reg||1
